+RWIF_18=No capture data yet. Pick a radio and a duration, then start a capture while the problem is happening.
+RWIF_19=With the channel on Auto the radio re-picks channel and width on every boot and wireless restart. Lock pins the currently running channel through the supported path; Unlock returns the radio to Auto.
+RWIF_20=Territory
+RWIF_21=Board workaround active (10G port interference)
+RWIF_22=Channel looks clean
